INVERTS its verdict when one is armed):

    MOJOLEARN_MAMBA2_SABOTAGE_SEGSUM_DESCENDING   S11's folds reversed
    MOJOLEARN_MAMBA2_SABOTAGE_CHUNK_SIZE_128      Q rebuilt at 128 (783's falsifier)
